                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[b]LOOT HERO DX[/b], is a old-school side-scroller incremental game. You have two controls, left, and right. All you do is run into enemies for combat, and collect gold when they die to upgrade your hero. You progress through more and more challenging stages with better and better upgrades for you hero. It is mindless early 2000s flash game fun. \n\n[b]PROS[/b]:\n          - Easy gameplay\n          - Satisfying combat\n\n[b]CONS[/b]:\n           - A bit repetitive\n             \n[i]What a throwback to Kongregate and Armor Games.[/i]",
